false, "body": "鳕鱼老师好！这次想约的是双人互动，想要粉毛拿狗链子牵着白毛的动作，其他老师自由发挥即可。具体的设定在链接内。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1BlWtX_H7UhpwjnQwox18Jdj5IvWDmvSz?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Shionegishimenn/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/63bd9d33/uploads/origins/ae5ac0c7-b524-4c98-b3dd-0d72ae19f127?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a8b4817e40d17a7864141ceb7b588ddc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/63bd9d33/uploads/origins/ae5ac0c7-b524-4c98-b3dd-0d72ae19f127?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a8b4817e40d17a7864141ceb7b588ddc, https://si.imgix.net/63bd9d33/uploads/origins/ae5ac0c7-b524-4c98-b3dd-0d72ae19f127?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f3c755781d8214cb42d24a9f428e2713 2x, https://si.imgix.net/63bd9d33/uploads/origins/ae5ac0c7-b524-4c98-b3dd-0d72ae19f127?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=192e052312fb3a4338cc9c1a0f48bd8c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Shime老师您好！想约自家的龙娘oc！服饰有123可选，选择您喜欢的就好！角色是天然呆、有些内向的性格，请自由发挥！感谢阅读~\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1i5sGcI6Q6-SP_GlhbYU43EHLajCL7qlY/view?usp=drivesdk", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Shionegishimenn/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/edc9f4f4/uploads/origins/d1d7afe1-8c75-4136-83ec-f20d0de9fcd2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6e8b717dab1d8948d68e39bed6bb557f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/edc9f4f4/uploads/origins/d1d7afe1-8c75-4136-83ec-f20d0de9fcd2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6e8b717dab1d8948d68e39bed6bb557f, https://si.imgix.net/edc9f4f4/uploads/origins/d1d7afe1-8c75-4136-83ec-f20d0de9fcd2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=67da8a97eb0ed43d779d24c9d97067bf 2x, https://si.imgix.net/edc9f4f4/uploads/origins/d1d7afe1-8c75-4136-83ec-f20d0de9fcd2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=13ea6ce29d2d18eb7900c6337c9e5ccf 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "鳕鱼老师好！想来尝试约一对cp稿件，角色设定资料：https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1NKheUHG_7THxUMTowKDonL8i2Hf8wODQ\n请当做盲盒摸鱼自由绘制就好，如果有任何不便的话取消或再送都无妨，感谢♪(^∇^*)", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Shionegishimenn/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/cf2ba82d/uploads/origins/eaef1165-3b3f-4213-b55e-503cf1dd0306?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fdc8137b3e9eba0583ed027646a419aa", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cf2ba82d/uploads/origins/eaef1165-3b3f-4213-b55e-503cf1dd0306?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fdc8137b3e9eba0583ed027646a419aa, https://si.imgix.net/cf2ba82d/uploads/origins/eaef1165-3b3f-4213-b55e-503cf1dd0306?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fab51b4f586903367fb84e97f677e3b6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cf2ba82d/uploads/origins/eaef1165-3b3f-4213-b55e-503cf1dd0306?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2d52ee6b9ea2d42a75a6188737005057 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "老师好，特别喜欢你画的，想请你画我家的搭档组，人物角色请帮我把人外特征去一下，很可惜两一个角色还停留在草稿阶段，给老师带来不必要的麻烦实在是不好意思，人物贴在下面\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1HdQcn-_n8q5_T-y-Vgi2ZyHNjorjQkKS/view?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Shionegishimenn/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a84cb93a/uploads/origins/a5a9896b-457a-4421-8a4e-b4f409bf9723?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1a71bb03bcecfcbc25dfbb6df8b010c4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a84cb93a/uploads/origins/a5a9896b-457a-4421-8a4e-b4f409bf9723?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1a71bb03bcecfcbc25dfbb6df8b010c4, https://si.imgix.net/a84cb93a/uploads/origins/a5a9896b-457a-4421-8